        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/chaosmancer/{size}/1977_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-25T20:44:51.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm going to throw in with Spiff as well. I backed at the highest level I could, but only because I love Sentinels as much as I do. I would not have backed this project otherwise simply because I have no feel for the game. I understand you guys keep saying you don't have finalized art, but the biggest thing I wanted to see with the \"gameplay\" video is actual gameplay with a small group. Maybe just a single turn, but seeing the game in action will tell me a lot about how it will work and what kind of strategies could be possible. Give us a solid preview and I think everything will roll much smoother.</p>",
