        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Ameena\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/48/1907_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Ameena:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Okay that's cool, I will do :). Yes, my Vengeance shipping was paid during the Shattered Timelines Kickstarter (I backed at the \"Shattered Vengeance\" level). I have no problems with waiting to get both at once :).</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>haha, I'm in exactly the same situation. Turns out cgrater helped out with my GSF pledge as well. Just like with Vengeance, I wouldn't have backed it without him having paid for my shipping.&nbsp;</p>",
