        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/koey/{size}/2187_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-05-08T01:27:35.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"waedens\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/w/b3f665/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> waedens:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Ok. Given the last kickstarter update I have a question. I have been wanting to get the sheet of extra tracking tokens, but I don't want to pay $10 shipping on a $5 order. I was thinking I would get them when I got vengece, but now I want to use my vengeance order to bump the kickstarter. Can I add $45 and note that I want both items? Or am I just pushing it?&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>If you are a current backer of GSF I am sure you can talk to them about adding the $40 for Vengeance and $5 for Tokens. So far &gt;G have been quite responsive so that is great.</p>",
